; Opcode $FF $95 (2 bytes): as Evt_OpFF94_WinC3E1Dark with mode 2
;   (WinFx_C3EMode2) and WinFx_Size = 2 (WinFx_SizeBit1): when done
;   Fade_Brightness = 0, Field_EventHook = 0, X = Y + 2. Otherwise X =
