    BRL Map_StepTileEffects
; The moved box's left corner is blocked too: drop the Y step and move
; straight right if the right corner allows it.
.up_right_only:
    REP #$20
    LDA.b !Map_ProbeY-!DP_Map
    SEC
    SBC.b !Map_Unk1D30-!DP_Map
